<title>USA: Derry Twp Sch Dist, Pa., won by PNC Securities.</title>
<headline>Derry Twp Sch Dist, Pa., won by PNC Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities Corp said it won $2.165 million of Derry Township School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.337 percent.</p>
